      "headline": "BISP Eligibility Criteria: Who Actually Qualifies for Benazir Kafaalat",
      "description": "BISP eligibility for Benazir Kafaalat is decided by a household's PMT score from the NSER survey, not a fixed income figure — the approved cutoff is 32, relaxed to 37 for households with a differently-abled member.",
